      "side": 1,
      "message": "When vmexit from guest with interrupt not injected, `__vmx_complete_interrupts` will set `KVM_REQ_EVENT` and queue interrupt via `kvm_queue_interrupt`. Then in `__pkvm_vcpu_enter_guest`, the `KVM_REQ_EVENT` is handled by `kvm_check_and_inject_events` which will inject the interrupt again by this code:\n```\n          else if (vcpu-\u003earch.interrupt.injected)\n                  kvm_x86_call(inject_irq)(vcpu, true);\n```",
      "parentUuid": "622f0e42_b603b3e1",
